<%- include('../partials/head', { title }) %>
<%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
<main class="main-area"><%- include('../partials/topbar', { title }) %><div class="page-content narrow-content"><%- include('../partials/alerts') %>
  <div class="page-back"><a href="/templates">← Template Marketplace</a></div>
  <section class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">TEMPLATE BUILDER / 8 STEPS</div><h1>Create your Discord bot</h1><p>Configure a supported template, connect your own bot token, choose modules and review Discord requirements before creation.</p></section>
  <% if (formError) { %><div class="notice notice-error"><span><%= formError %></span></div><% } %>
  <div class="builder-progress" data-builder-progress><span class="active">01 Template</span><span>02 Identity</span><span>03 Token</span><span>04 Features</span><span>05 Commands</span><span>06 Permissions</span><span>07 Review</span><span>08 Create</span></div>
  <form class="panel form-panel builder-form" method="post" action="/bots" autocomplete="off" data-builder-form>
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="1"><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h2>Select Template</h2><p>Choose a published, compatible runtime manifest or start with all currently supported modules.</p></div></div>
      <label class="field-label" for="template-select">Template</label><select class="input" id="template-select" name="template_id"><option value="" data-name="Complete System" data-features="<%= JSON.stringify(availableFeatures) %>" data-commands="<%= JSON.stringify(allCommands.map(command=>command.name)) %>" data-permissions="<%= JSON.stringify(['View Channels','Send Messages','Embed Links','Read Message History']) %>" data-intents="<%= JSON.stringify(['Guilds','GuildMembers','GuildMessages','MessageContent']) %>" <%= !selectedTemplate?'selected':'' %>>Complete System — all supported modules</option><% templates.forEach(item=>{ %><option value="<%= item.id %>" data-name="<%= item.name %>" data-features="<%= JSON.stringify(item.features) %>" data-commands="<%= JSON.stringify(item.commands) %>" data-permissions="<%= JSON.stringify(item.permissions) %>" data-intents="<%= JSON.stringify(item.intents) %>" <%= selectedTemplate?.id===item.id?'selected':'' %>><%= item.name %> — <%= item.category %> (requires <%= item.minPlan %>)</option><% }) %></select>
      <div class="template-option"><span class="template-icon">◈</span><div><b><%= selectedTemplate ? selectedTemplate.name : 'Complete System' %></b><small><%= selectedTemplate ? selectedTemplate.description : 'All runtime modules currently supported by this release.' %></small><small>Current plan: <%= plan.name %> · Bot limit: <%= plan.bot_limit %></small></div><span class="selected-pill">READY</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="2" hidden><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h2>Bot Information</h2><p>Set the identity shown in your workspace.</p></div></div>
      <label class="field-label" for="bot-name">Bot Name <em>Required</em></label><input class="input" id="bot-name" name="name" minlength="2" maxlength="48" required placeholder="e.g. ROVEX Community Bot">
      <label class="field-label" for="bot-description">Description</label><textarea class="input textarea" id="bot-description" name="description" maxlength="240" rows="3" placeholder="What does your bot do?"></textarea>
      <label class="field-label" for="bot-avatar">Avatar URL <small>Optional · HTTPS only</small></label><input class="input" id="bot-avatar" name="avatar_url" type="url" placeholder="https://example.com/avatar.png">
    </section>
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="3" hidden><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h2>Connect Discord Bot Token</h2><p>Provide a token from the Discord Developer Portal. It is validated against Discord and encrypted before storage.</p></div></div>
      <label class="field-label" for="bot-token">Bot Token <em>Required</em></label><input class="input" id="bot-token" name="token" type="password" minlength="40" maxlength="300" required autocomplete="new-password" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Paste bot token">
      <div class="secure-callout"><span>♢</span><div><b>AES-256-GCM encryption</b><p>The token is never sent back to the browser or written to runtime logs. Never share it with anyone.</p></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="4" hidden><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">04</span><div><h2>Choose Features</h2><p>Feature flags are isolated per bot and can be changed later.</p></div></div><input type="hidden" name="features_present" value="1"><div class="builder-choice-grid"><% availableFeatures.forEach(feature=>{ const enabled = selectedTemplate ? selectedTemplate.features.includes(feature) : true; %><label class="builder-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="feature_keys" value="<%= feature %>" <%= enabled?'checked':'' %>><span><b><%= feature %></b><small>Platform runtime module</small></span></label><% }) %></div></section>
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="5" hidden><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">05</span><div><h2>Configure Commands</h2><p>Select only commands supported by the chosen features.</p></div></div><input type="hidden" name="commands_present" value="1"><div class="builder-command-grid"><% allCommands.forEach(command=>{ const enabled = selectedTemplate ? selectedTemplate.commands.includes(command.name) : true; %><label class="builder-command"><input type="checkbox" name="command_names" value="<%= command.name %>" <%= enabled?'checked':'' %>><span><b>/<%= command.name %></b><small><%= command.description %></small></span></label><% }) %></div></section>
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="6" hidden><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">06</span><div><h2>Discord Permissions & Intents</h2><p>Review the permission scopes required by the selected preset. Grant only what your enabled features use.</p></div></div><div class="builder-requirement"><b>Bot Permissions</b><p data-builder-permissions>View Channels · Send Messages · Embed Links · Read Message History</p><p>Grant the listed permissions when inviting your bot. Discord role hierarchy and server-level overrides still apply.</p></div><div class="builder-requirement"><b>Gateway Intents</b><p data-builder-intents>Guilds</p><p>Enable privileged intents in the Discord Developer Portal when requested by the selected runtime modules.</p></div></section>
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="7" hidden><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">07</span><div><h2>Review Settings</h2><p>Confirm your configuration before creating the bot.</p></div></div><div class="builder-review"><div><small>Bot name</small><b data-review-name>Not entered</b></div><div><small>Template</small><b data-review-template><%= selectedTemplate?.name || 'Complete System' %></b></div><div><small>Features selected</small><b data-review-features>—</b></div><div><small>Commands selected</small><b data-review-commands>—</b></div><div><small>Plan</small><b><%= plan.name %></b></div><div><small>Bot allocation</small><b><%= plan.bot_limit %> bot(s)</b></div></div><div class="notice notice-info"><span>Creation validates the Discord token, enforces plan limits, stores encrypted credentials, installs the manifest and requests a real Gateway connection.</span></div></section>
    <section class="builder-step" data-builder-step="8" hidden><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-number">08</span><div><h2>Create Bot</h2><p>Your bot record and platform data will be created, then the runtime will attempt to connect to Discord.</p></div></div><div class="secure-callout"><span>✓</span><div><b>Final checks</b><p>Make sure the bot exists in the Developer Portal, the token is current, and required intents are enabled.</p></div></div><div class="form-actions"><a class="button button-ghost" href="/bots">Cancel</a><button class="button button-primary" type="submit"><%= t('create_connect') %> <span>→</span></button></div></section>
    <div class="builder-navigation"><button class="button button-ghost" type="button" data-builder-back disabled>← Back</button><span data-builder-step-label>Step 1 of 8</span><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-builder-next>Continue →</button></div>
  </form>
  <div class="muted-note">All 25 catalog templates have platform runtime modules. Music requires direct HTTPS Ogg/Opus streams; AI and translation require provider configuration in the bot Integrations page.</div>
</div></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
